<p>If you expanded on the &quot;lovesick&quot; side of the trope a bit, it could be interesting, where the doll punishes the man for leaving her alone for too long. Also, the western otaku angle would be interesting, as well as fit into the AWCY philosophy.</p>
<p>It would also be interesting to look into her sentience, especially in terms of various Japanese revenge tales. That is, is she based on a real woman who was wronged in real life, and the doll gives her a chance to get that revenge.</p>
<p>It's a good idea, it just needs to be fleshed out some.</p>

