<p>It's an interesting idea, but limited in terms of testing (once The Foundation has a few solid tests in terms of the progression they'll likely stop). The two biggest problems are how to stop or even reset the progression, and how to actually find it.</p>
<p>Also, you may want to consider that just creating an SCP that's annoying is usually not enough, but has to have some sort of narrative background to it, such as where it comes from, was it designed by a group with a specific agenda in mind, or even an accident of evolution.</p>
<p>It's a good basic idea, but needs to be fleshed out some.</p>

