						<a href="/forum/t-13832996/nobody-is-bored-and-for-some-reason-a-hive">Nobody is Bored. (and for some reason a Hive)</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4831481">
									

<p>First of all a big thank you also to you for taking the time and effort to give me feedback.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Nobody&nbsp;here</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Nobody&nbsp;still&nbsp;here</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>I believe 'gestalts' would be the correct word here?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I wanted to make a pun, as Gestalten in German can also mean &quot;suspicious figures&quot; in certain contexts.<br />
As an example:</p>
<p>German<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span>– Einige dubiose Gestalten schlichen um das Haus herum.<br />
English<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span>– Some dubious crooks crept around the house.</p>
<p>I find this funny in the context of Nobody, because Nobody is exactly the type of person who is up to something at night and in the fog.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>If they're physically separated, why are they all writing on the same page?<br />
Like it'd make sense for a few of them to get together and write on the same page but there's like…20? of them?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I had planned to make it no more than 7, but when I counted, I came up with 13 or so. I'm going to change that.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>I'm a little torn on this as a whole</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I see what you mean, this is also the reason why I so urgently request feedback.</p>
<p>If this article survives, I will certainly write a serious tale where I develop the idea of a &quot;Nobody gang&quot;. Just the idea that they keep their personalities after the &quot;Noodle Incident&quot; and the whole group tries to get along with each other is very entertaining for me.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

